OL,3,GNEWSAHarris asks politicians for
OL,4,Afeedback on Irish unity 'blueprint'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe tanaiste (Irish deputy prime
OL,7,Fminister) has asked some political
OL,8,Fparties in Northern Ireland and the
OL,9,Frepublic for feedback on his party's
OL,10,Fso-called "blueprint" on Irish unity.
OL,12,FSimon Harris' party Fine Gael published
OL,13,Fproposals on how to prepare for Irish
OL,14,Funity last week. He has now asked some
OL,15,Fparty leaders in Northern Ireland for
OL,16,Ftheir views, including unionist
OL,17,Fparties.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
