OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHarris asks politicians for
OL,4,Afeedback on Irish unity 'blueprint'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes days after the taoiseach
OL,7,F(Irish prime minister), leader of
OL,8,FFianna Fail, circulated a document to
OL,9,Fhis parliamentary party laying out his
OL,10,Fown thoughts on how to prepare for a
OL,11,Funited Ireland.
OL,13,FAmong their proposals, Fine Gael has
OL,14,Fsuggested appointing a junior minister
OL,15,Fin the Irish government for "north
OL,16,Fsouth relations".
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
